  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mn>2</mn></math> distinct numbers are between <math><mn>0</mn></math> to <math><mn>180</mn></math> (both inclusive) and the probability that their average is <math><mn>60</mn></math> is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math>, then <math><mn>1086</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mn>2</mn></math> distinct number are <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math>  <br/><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn></math>  <br/>if <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> then <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> then <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>119</mn></math>  <br/>. <br/>. <br/>. <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>59</mn></math> then <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>61</mn></math>  <br/>favourable case <math><mo>=</mo></math> 60 <br/>Total case <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>181</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  <br/>Required probability <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>181</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>543</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math>  <br/><math><mn>1086</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>"
